variable half_box_len equal 38.7481352328112/2.0

### simulation parameters:

variable time_step_length equal 2.5e-3
variable equi_time_steps equal 50
variable dump_ts_freq equal 5e4
variable cutoff equal 15.0                                        # cutoff for pairwise calculations

